  '[[\'In the Stripe Dashboard add a webhook endpoint with this URL and the events payment_intent.succeeded, payment_intent.payment_failed, payment_intent.canceled, charge.refunded, customer.subscription.created, customer.subscription.updated, customer.subscription.deleted, invoice.paid and invoice.payment_failed, then save its signing secret above. An endpoint set up earlier for Flux Forms keeps working.\', \'en\']]' => 'Dans le tableau de bord Stripe, ajoutez un point de terminaison webhook avec cette URL et les événements payment_intent.succeeded, payment_intent.payment_failed, payment_intent.canceled, charge.refunded, customer.subscription.created, customer.subscription.updated, customer.subscription.deleted, bill.paid et bill.payment_failed, puis enregistrez son secret de signature ci-dessus. Un point de terminaison configuré précédemment pour Flux Forms continue de fonctionner.',
